OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe BBC Philharmonic Orchestra is
OL,7,     Fjoined by the Audi Young Persons'
OL,8,     FChoral Academy, Julia Gruter and
OL,9,     FJoshua Hopkins for Brahms's A
OL,10,     FGerman Requiem.
OL,11,G2145 The Essay: This Sounding Isle
OL,12,     FKate Kennedy follows in the
OL,13,     Ffootsteps of composer Havergal
OL,14,     FBrian from the Staffordshire
OL,15,     FPotteries, to seek connections
OL,16,     Fbetween a place and the music it
OL,17,     Fhas inspired.
